                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Look, this isn't a great game by any means; it's clearly an unpolished mess and a 7/10 at most. It was quite frustrating at times, but I don't regret buying it because it made me smile a lot.\n\nThe developers clearly love cats. There are plenty of charming moments, like earning an achievement for knocking over pots in a graveyard, or getting a deployable box with \"Schrödinger's cat\" written on it. If you're a cat lover, you won't regret playing this.\n\n",
